#: MainFrame.cpp:258
msgid ""
"What the preview shows: the decoded HAM6 result, a map of the HAM operation "
"used for each pixel (black = Select, red/green/blue = Modify R/G/B), or an "
"error map (brightness = distance from the source image, white = 0.10 OKLab "
"or more). F6 cycles through the views. The error map is only available for "
"the single-frame preview, not while an animation plays."
msgstr ""

